{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Them coats... Back at their usual.\" He bows his head, thinking of all that have fallen.","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:33:02.684000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867610164709163008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Bonafide Bone","id":"467139287192829977","is_bot":0,"username":".bonafidebone"},"author_id":"467139287192829977","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"he does not end that thought","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:33:08.120000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T03:33:12.890000Z","id":"867610187510972466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"They came in overwhelming force sir. It is hard to know if it was at the same time, or if we were simply the last. Either way, I couldn't track their infrastructure. I'm sorry if we failed you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:33:19.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867610233182224404","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"No, it's alright, we were surprised and unfortunately betrayed by a few positions in power\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:33:57.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867610395304919050","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"It isn't your fault.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:34:03.225000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867610418637570058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Thank you for saying so Sir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:34:17.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867610477231472692","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"What would your commanding officer have had you do next, try to retake the base, burn it, or is there something needing retrieval?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:34:57.529000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T03:36:25.249000Z","id":"867610646404792391","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
