{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"Finn Midask: 27/27 (8 temp)","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:35:20.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867610741993111633","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"Willow: 27/27 (8 temp)","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:35:32.336000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867610792395407410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"The factory is a terrible thing Sir. My commanding officer, well he was captured too. He helped me escape to bring the news to the Revolution.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:36:46.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867611101997563914","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Beyond that I was not told.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:37:00.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867611162131562507","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"So we have survivors left there\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:37:03.403000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867611174357958677","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"It is likely he held little hope for me to make it here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:37:12.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867611214287863858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"There are some. There are tasks in the factory too dangerous for the Red Coats. The lucky few among us where the mechanics. The rest of us moved molten metal around and worked the forges.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:38:16.540000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T03:38:22.334000Z","id":"867611481116901466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"A valuable target then. How many redcoats would be left to garrison do you think? Any chance of us wresting back control? Or does this need to be covert in and out?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:39:19.343000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867611744532168734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"Eliza: 27/27 (8 temp)","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:39:33.404000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867611803509063710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Like I said sir. An overwhelming force. It would take the brunt of the continental army's forces in the region to destroy it sir. I'd suggest not risking a frontal assault. Not with those machines they are building.\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:41:15.843000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-22T03:41:23.175000Z","id":"867612233168322590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Those machines, they can talk and have multiple arms yes? We might have seen them during the invasion. Any way to take control of them and turn them to our cause?\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:42:13.729000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867612475960066065","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Or if not, then sabotage the factory\"","created_at":"2021-07-22T03:42:24.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867612522437279774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
